 "description": "One block header decoded: height, time, author, gas used vs limit, base fee in gwei and transaction count. Readable numbers, not raw hex. Costs $0.001 USDC per call. Chains: base, ethereum, arbitrum, bsc, polygon, optimism, avalanche. Byte-identical to GET /chain/block?chain=base&block=latest.",
